    "working_thesis": "The human condition comprises distinct activities—primarily labor, work, and action—whose historical and theoretical conflation in the modern age, specifically through the elevation of the animal laborans and utilitarian instrumentalism, threatens the stability of the human world and the true nature of human freedom."
